    {
      "text": "Gantt chart of two sample timelines (darker and lighter bars) across weeks 1–15 for seven stages of developing an eHealth action plan, from managing the process and engaging stakeholders to defining implementation phases. The longer timeline runs to week 15 and the shorter one ends at week 9.",
